rule.ipfw_r_ipfrags = 0;
rule.ipfw_r_ipflags = 0;
rule.ipfw_r_ipfilter = IPFW_ACCEPT;
rule.ipfw_r_jump = IPFW_JUMP_ACCEPT;
```

4. Send the rule to IPFW:

```c
if (send(ipfw_control_socket, &rule, sizeof(rule), 0) == -1) {
    perror("send");
    exit(EXIT_FAILURE);
}
```

5. Close the socket:

```c
close(ipfw_control_socket);
```

